{
  "about": "veffshaper: a parametric waveshaper in the unit's own lists of effects (sounds and master) and on fx train's wagons. Knobs: drive (-12..+24 dB), curve (a saturating cubic), depth (a sine ripple along the curve, fold-like), mix; with shift held: lin, damp (flattens near zero), period (the ripple's cycles) and output (0..-24 dB). Page: the common Veff page, the input sine and the shaped wave with the pink area between them. Stands on punch; changes no place of the firmware; needs the base.",
